## Why This Is Asked

Tests CSS layout for responsiveness, JS-free interactive patterns, and motion accessibility. Also evaluates how well a candidate uses native HTML semantics with clean CSS.

## Key Concepts

- CSS Grid responsive columns
- details/summary accessibility without JS
- height/opacity animation via max-height
- prefers-reduced-motion handling
- focus-visible outlines

## Code Example

